           M.Veselsky,S.J.Yennello,A.Bonasera)
REFERENCE  (J,PR/C,113,034621,2026)
           #doi:10.1103/9swx-tph4
INSTITUTE  (2GRCTUA,2GRCIOA,3CZRCTI,1USATAM,2ITYLNS)
FACILITY   (CYCLO,1USATAM) The K500 superconducting
           cyclotron of the Cyclotron Institute of Texas A&M.
DETECTOR   (SPEC,PPAC,SI,TELES) Momentum Achromat Recoil
           Spectrometer (MARS), a parallel-plate avalanche counter
            (PPAC), a dE-E Si detector telescope.
METHOD     (EDE)
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-S) Statistical uncertainties.
STATUS     (APRVD) Approved by O.Fasoula on June 17, 2026.
HISTORY    (20260422C) BP
