BIB                  4         13
REACTION   (28-NI-64(36-KR-86,X)28-NI-64,,DA)
SAMPLE     Isotopically enriched targets of 64Ni with
           thickness 2.2 mg/cm2.
ANALYSIS   The angular distribution of the inelastic channel.
           Authors refer to this channel as the "inelastic"
           channel and assume that, apart from inelastic (Coulomb)
           excitation of the target, it originates from processes
           of nucleon pickup, stripping, and evaporation, leading
           to no net nucleon transfer from the target to the
           projectile.
