           thickness 2.0 mg/cm2.
ANALYSIS   The double differential distribution of the inelastic
           channel. Authors refer to this channel as the
           "inelastic" channel and assume that, apart from
           inelastic (Coulomb) excitation of the target, it
           originates from processes of nucleon pickup, stripping,
            and evaporation, leading to no net nucleon transfer
           from the target to the projectile.
